  12: 
  13:     Rule
  14:     - Draw each guide row or column across the whole grid in the marker color.
  15:     - Any 4-connected object-color component that overlaps or 4-neighbor touches a completed guide line is recolored entirely to the marker color.
  16: 
  17:     Key insight
  18:     - The border markers are not objects to move; they are controls for guide lines whose contact with object components selects the objects to recolor.
  19:     """
